Byte-to-Variation-Selector Conversion
Each byte of the wrapped manifest shall be converted to a Unicode variation selector using the following algorithm:
function byteToVariationSelector(byte b) {
if (b >= 0 && b <= 15) {
return U+FE00 + b;
} else if (b >= 16 && b <= 255) {
return U+E0100 + (b - 16);
}
}
A.8.3.2.
